{"game": "elden-ring-nightreign", "language": "english", "appid": 2622380, "month": "2025-07", "window": 2, "start_date": 1751932800, "end_date": 1752623999, "month_true_total": 7115, "quota": 27, "returned": 27, "pulled_at": "2026-10-04 23:46:18 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "199898546", "author": {"steamid": "76561198017785329", "personaname": "DOMINJA", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Iwanna69whilst420/", "num_games_owned": 288, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 5071, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3494, "last_played": 1771645462, "avatar": "071c593c90b224b66b4af65d148bfa15efcc354c"}, "language": "english", "review": "From an botchy early launch to something I enjoy greatly, if you enjoyed elden ring but wanted some rouge-like elements with fast leveling, flashy moves and flashy spells, character based story progression, independent and unique way of enhancing your characters (relics) and fun friendly co-op, I highly recommend playing this with 1 or 2 friends, whilst it was hellish to queue when the game came out, it is now completely fine with just 1 but a full party goes into the game straight away\n\n(beware the bell bearing hunter and the occasional ultra instinct bosses)", "timestamp_created": 1752623995, "timestamp_updated": 1752623995, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199898458", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043885994", "personaname": "CreeCree", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/creecree/", "num_games_owned": 271, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 43817, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9798, "last_played": 1785747479, "avatar": "1c420d178f66d4691b32a82a49ec20a7825e74d9"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's not Elden Ring and that's not a bad thing. The familiarity of Elden Ring can help ease into the game, but be warned it takes a few hours for the game to \"click\". Really shines with multiplayer and my experience with random players has been overall positive. Player skill is varied, so who you matchmake with is part of the randomness of the run! \r\n\r\nRecommended for fans of multiplayer co-op, roguelikes, and action games. \r\n\r\nSolid game, hopeful we will see a Nightreign 2 some day.", "timestamp_created": 1752623906, "timestamp_updated": 1752623906, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199898357", "author": {"steamid": "76561198057214284", "personaname": "Curvysumo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198057214284/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 7603, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7579, "last_played": 1752623902, "avatar": "198fe94358c7451d91b71229efab9efe3fe97a76"}, "language": "english", "review": "Not fun boring game play loop not nearly enough content dont buy.", "timestamp_created": 1752623775, "timestamp_updated": 1752623775, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "199898147", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993616217", "personaname": "Flea", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/felipecamposfabel/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 18412, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7200, "last_played": 1787625097, "avatar": "da30241def33fad6261a7996dbd3aa5609faf44e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Amazing!", "timestamp_created": 1752623512, "timestamp_updated": 1752623512, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199897559", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970399323", "personaname": "WombatShuffle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/wombatshuffle/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 17089, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5416, "last_played": 1768872680, "avatar": "ba16b95fec56f2a6ce928817f2ca420d38e9c25a"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's extremely difficult, not just the boss mechanics and pacing, but the team dynamics, the RNG, and the nonsensical UI.... but, I think about each run hours after. I obsess over getting better, trying different pathing, and moving quicker. Most of all though, it has what I really crave in gaming, which is elation... not the feeling of success, not a \"yay\", or a predicted win... elation. Each run is stressful, upsetting or unpredicted (at least to a casual like myself), but when you beat a boss that you've been struggling with for days or weeks = elation. I feel like many games have go the path of feel good or ease you in, which is pretty feel good, but sometimes a game that just kicks your ass brings you back to how games used to be... feels pretty damn good as well. 10/10.", "timestamp_created": 1752622797, "timestamp_updated": 1752622797, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199897157", "author": {"steamid": "76561198086953840", "personaname": "Shadow Heart Enjoyer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/tabomalo/", "num_games_owned": 200, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 4640, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2733, "last_played": 1768930326, "avatar": "73229bbbe836bd3b53e196f81a1bac188b503818"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you like fromsoft combat then this game is a solid 8-8.5 out of 10. It is a very enjoyable time with friends and with the solo changes fun as a solo player too. \r\n\r\nThe main issues holding this game back is the lack of bosses, there is simply not enough nightlords and field bosses in the game, I would say the majority of players will be able to finish this game in 40 hours or less. Is a 40 hour game with no story worth the price, that is for you to decide.", "timestamp_created": 1752622346, "timestamp_updated": 1752622346, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199897060", "author": {"steamid": "76561198366701378", "personaname": "Askicker243", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Askicker243/", "num_games_owned": 480, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 46236, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 217, "playtime_at_review": 4320, "last_played": 1791000129, "avatar": "53c5047805cd7299a6306372f742261612b34fa4"}, "language": "english", "review": "After 100% finishing the game doing all the characters rememberances and all the good fun builds and the bad buggy parts I would recomend this game if you want a spin off dark souls game, with the rougelike mechanics and all the different ways to build a character for status effects or abilities, tank, damage, magic and the like I had a blast playing and will continue to play myself. For all the times I was completely just destroyed by poor time management or a boss spamming an ability or getting stuck in the enviornment I had just as many runs where I got legendary after legendary and went to just 3 or 4 shot the final boss and I tell you what going toe to toe against a boss slugging it out is THE BEST!", "timestamp_created": 1752622225, "timestamp_updated": 1752622225, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199896305", "author": {"steamid": "76561198817283508", "personaname": "Barry Bondage", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198817283508/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 8098, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3379, "last_played": 1767116689, "avatar": "8442685651231b08503c282a75c5f324df2ae085"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is NOT for everyone. It is no masterpiece of narrative like Elden Ring, and is far easier, but has greatly streamlined and innovated upon the combat and progression of previous Soulsborne games. \r\nGood game", "timestamp_created": 1752621363, "timestamp_updated": 1752621363, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199896064", "author": {"steamid": "76561199229067950", "personaname": "brayxenn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199229067950/", "num_games_owned": 53, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 2371, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 218, "last_played": 1766867685, "avatar": "94910f47fc0fa83fc70e018595d922d74866a576"}, "language": "english", "review": "this game ♥♥♥♥♥", "timestamp_created": 1752621105, "timestamp_updated": 1752621105, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199895963", "author": {"steamid": "76561198121057897", "personaname": "Kenan", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198121057897/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 60315, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9661, "last_played": 1781502618, "avatar": "79d3fe5839617eb83a9661071ed021dd56ac8a5b"}, "language": "english", "review": "I was pretty skeptical, but MMOs and Souls games are some of my favorite things, so Nightreign having elements from both is a winning formula for me.  I could see it not for everyone, but it scratches a particular itch for me.  Great game with updates more updates coming soon hopefully.", "timestamp_created": 1752620977, "timestamp_updated": 1752620977, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199895754", "author": {"steamid": "76561198267326822", "personaname": "Baguette", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198267326822/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 146427, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5832, "last_played": 1781379021, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun\n\nShame they made raider's moveset this terrible though when using colossals, greathammers and greataxes :(", "timestamp_created": 1752620743, "timestamp_updated": 1752682792, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.488505750894546509", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199895293", "author": {"steamid": "76561198262874598", "personaname": "Doctor Chicken", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/PapaDankaFranku/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 102327, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 181, "playtime_at_review": 37969, "last_played": 1790651702, "avatar": "0e96fd1da4c91017a7c1de980d6361b139e6831d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good game overall but it's got some issues;\n\nNeeds some bugs fixed (bosses not dropping items, and interacting with a spirithawk tree will force you to walk forward against your will sometimes to name some)\nAlso desperately needs search strings for the Relic Rites page, the current available methods of sorting is too little to cover everything you'd want\n\nAll in all a pleasant fromsoft experience and a good way for people to get a grip on core mechanics before tackling the mainline series\n\nEdits had to be made since a decent amount has changed in this game. \n\nVery needed to have made a more detailed searching criteria for relics, great change. Also I think the spirithawk bug is fixed since that hasn't personally happened for a while. Same goes for bosses with no drops happening I think is also fixed now.\nBut now another complaint I have since of the release of Deep of Night: the relic storage cap is still 1955 relics, so if you had a huge amount (like I do, I hit the cap before that mode even released), you'd have to juggle between making decisions to trash normal relics and deep relics. A relic storage increase I feel is absolutely necessary since of this entirely new mode out that requires more relics; if the current cap is doubled then it's an extremely easy fix. Also there's some weird lighting glitch where the entire area gets extraordinarily dark out of nowhere and that's been there since launch too. As far as I know that is also a bug in Elden Ring so I don't expect this to get fixed.\n\nNow that those previously stated bugs/problems are fixed I'd safely say the game is in a much better state for smooth gameplay and easier min-maxing. Definitely something to pick up with some friends too to make Deep of Night a more pleasing experience.", "timestamp_created": 1752620209, "timestamp_updated": 1758512145, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199894795", "author": {"steamid": "76561199100597058", "personaname": "F1ldoz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199100597058/", "num_games_owned": 70, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 782, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 782, "last_played": 1750097032, "avatar": "b6c32201c012d919875bb9f22554288bfd5a300d"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game gets boring and repetetive after few hours. For 40 euro its just not worth it.", "timestamp_created": 1752619664, "timestamp_updated": 1752619664, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.494071155786514282", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199894594", "author": {"steamid": "76561198075438022", "personaname": "Moridan.14", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jk_moridan/", "num_games_owned": 96, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 6434, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5150, "last_played": 1754796825, "avatar": "6204068bd7155726d6db33e453debe884dd2e496"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fast paced souls-like. The learning curve is really easy, and you don't need to have played souls games before to enjoy this one.", "timestamp_created": 1752619440, "timestamp_updated": 1752619440, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199894509", "author": {"steamid": "76561198836207047", "personaname": "Bobi_Parata", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198836207047/", "num_games_owned": 129, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 7339, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4119, "last_played": 1787699821, "avatar": "69dd99d211afa597e133bc35eb56051d1ee1c078"}, "language": "english", "review": "FIX YOUR SERVERS AND DELETE ENHANCED GAPING JAW RAAAH. Overall pretty fun tho", "timestamp_created": 1752619355, "timestamp_updated": 1752619355, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199894205", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040121278", "personaname": "afongui", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198040121278/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 16642, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4432, "last_played": 1780089534, "avatar": "8cae251a138eba9f81ca8c0fe5e632f23861d148"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pretty nice man, it is thje first souls like game i play and now feel more confidente to play other souls like games, only fall damege will be a thing LOL", "timestamp_created": 1752619050, "timestamp_updated": 1752619050, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199894204", "author": {"steamid": "76561198001726504", "personaname": "GreenDolphin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ifeellikefishin/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 6333, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1711, "deck_playtime_at_review": 1711, "last_played": 1756591461, "avatar": "97a05840ddd3f2f5d2dd124786f15439319724a4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun game when you get to play it, but currently its almost unplayable due to bad handling of connection issues.\nIn the majority of the games I played I had really frustrating experience, because if you have even a momentarily connection issue you get immediately thrown out of the game, which then either:\n a. The game mana